                "Aldol AD-1 on Pentaol-Croftle PC-6 already measures 2.8 wt% dissolved formaldehyde "
                "versus a 1.6 wt% acetaldehyde ceiling. Canopy thermography still advertises 0.9 wt% "
                "as though the kettle sat idle. Analyzer-first should throttle formalin; canopy-first "
                "would ride 2.8 wt% through dump.",